# Two white rowboats (issue 076, from one of Marc's unhung pieces): a weathered grey frame, dark choppy water with pale gold glints, a smaller boat behind and a larger one in front, white hulls, brown rims and dark brown insides, a rope. 32x16 wall slot, tall frame centred.
size: 32x16
